From 2f8fbfd2f13111c8dab15671599520a178976f5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy <andylee77@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:09:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/22] thingino-raptor: non-Ingenic link fix and day/night for
 PWM IR banks (ric)

raptor patches 0101-0105: LDFLAGS_HAL links libimp and libalog on Ingenic
only (any other HAL failed to link); ric's irled_cmd hook for an IR bank that
is not on a GPIO, the luma trigger for such banks and days that stick, an IR
level ladder stepped by night gain, and exposure polled on a fixed cadence.
The raptor patches are numbered from 0101, so the patches Thingino itself
carries in package/thingino-raptor/ (from 0001) apply first.

The three new [ircut] keys (irled_cmd, ir_levels, ir_step_gain) are
RAPTOR_IRCUT_* options in thingino-raptor-config (Kconfig and conf-map).
thingino-raptor's Config.in and .mk also carry the package side of the later
patches: the Streamer menu options (BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_RAPTOR_UI_*), the
SCL ring depth and AE max-shutter options, the sigmastar-lib build order, and
the SigmaStar installs (the web UI flags and the watchdog).
